## State discipline

- state.json is written ONLY via `scripts/chain state`, findings ONLY via
  `bash scripts/chain findings` — never with ad-hoc edits or raw jq writes.
- Before starting real work: if `.phase + ":" + .status` is not already
  `{{PHASE}}:running`, run
  `bash scripts/chain state transition {{PROJ_NUMBER}} {{THEME}} {{PHASE}} running`.
- WRITER lane, on full completion only:
  `bash scripts/chain state transition {{PROJ_NUMBER}} {{THEME}} {{PHASE}} done`
  — this seals the phase; the runner verifies it. Never seal a phase
  whose work is incomplete; on an unresolvable blocker, stop and report
  it in your final output instead (the runner executes the stop policy).
